# PASS witness for scap_010_capability_requires_realization: capability WITH a realization.
@prefix scap: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scheduling-capability#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

scap:w-cap a scap:Capability ; dcterms:identifier "Schedule.Witness" ; rdfs:label "Schedule.Witness" .
scap:w-real a scap:CapabilityRealization ; scap:realizes scap:w-cap .
